WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:04.210
In the early 2000s,

00:00:04.210 --> 00:00:06.752
a new phrase entered
the Chinese vernacular,

00:00:06.752 --> 00:00:08.980
renzao meinü.

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:11.080
It means artificial beauty

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:13.170
and it laid the foundation
for what's become

00:00:13.170 --> 00:00:15.603
a cultural phenomenon in China:

00:00:15.603 --> 00:00:18.311
cosmetic treatments.

00:00:21.210 --> 00:00:24.370
The Miss Plastic Surgery Pageant in 2004

00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:26.460
marked the country's growing acceptance

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:28.750
towards going under the knife.

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:31.410
All part of the cosmetic surgery boom

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:34.050
fueled by the country's
burgeoning middle class

00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:35.820
who have more disposable income

00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:38.479
than any generation before them.

00:00:46.830 --> 00:00:48.160
If you look historically,

00:00:48.160 --> 00:00:50.850
sociologically and philosophically,

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:54.940
beauty has always been a
commodity, for centuries.

00:00:54.940 --> 00:00:57.080
You go back to the ancient Egyptians,

00:00:57.080 --> 00:00:58.350
or the ancient Chinese,

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:00.170
they always placed a very high regard

00:01:00.170 --> 00:01:02.150
on people who were beautiful.

00:01:02.150 --> 00:01:04.860
What's changed nowadays is that

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:07.530
you can buy a bit of that beauty.

00:01:07.530 --> 00:01:10.940
But as they say, beauty is
in the eye of the beholder.

00:01:10.940 --> 00:01:13.730
In China, however, beauty is increasingly

00:01:13.730 --> 00:01:16.290
becoming in the hands of plastic surgeons.

00:01:16.290 --> 00:01:17.440
The country's facial

00:01:17.440 --> 00:01:20.673
and body enhancement industry is booming.

00:01:22.350 --> 00:01:23.440
The market in China

00:01:23.440 --> 00:01:26.060
is now worth over $30 billion,

00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:29.133
making up 17% of the global industry.

00:01:30.580 --> 00:01:33.940
Innovations in nonsurgical
and surgical procedures

00:01:33.940 --> 00:01:37.333
have brought prices down to a
cost accessible to everyone.

00:01:38.340 --> 00:01:43.340
With the advent of
dissolvable fillers, botox,

00:01:43.610 --> 00:01:48.080
we have realized that we can
achieve some form of beauty

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:51.080
without actually having
to undergo the knife.

00:01:51.080 --> 00:01:53.510
The arrival of dedicated cosmetic apps

00:01:53.510 --> 00:01:57.200
have made booking surgery as
simple as ordering a takeout.

00:01:57.200 --> 00:02:00.770
But breakout growth has left
regulators playing catch-up.

00:02:00.770 --> 00:02:03.100
And as the Chinese government
looks to crack down

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:05.240
on the cosmetic surgery industry,

00:02:05.240 --> 00:02:07.963
the days of paying for
perfection might be numbered.

00:02:22.320 --> 00:02:27.060
So I've been in China,
operating, working, teaching,

00:02:27.060 --> 00:02:31.360
and observing the changing
trends for the last 17 years

00:02:31.360 --> 00:02:36.220
and I will say that people
have gotten a lot more bold

00:02:36.220 --> 00:02:38.503
in what they want to see for themselves.

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:41.550
Dr. Woffles Wu,

00:02:41.550 --> 00:02:43.490
who currently operates out of Singapore,

00:02:43.490 --> 00:02:47.010
has been a plastic
surgeon for over 30 years.

00:02:47.010 --> 00:02:50.060
In 2006 he was appointed the Honorary Head

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:52.910
of Plastic Surgery at
a hospital in Hangzhou,

00:02:52.910 --> 00:02:55.460
where he trains surgeons.

00:02:55.460 --> 00:02:57.660
Over the years, he's seen China's industry

00:02:57.660 --> 00:03:00.880
grow not only in size, but also ambition.

00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:02.320
20 years ago,

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:05.300
it would have been the
usual kind of double eyelid,

00:03:05.300 --> 00:03:08.450
or maybe a little bit of
a higher nasal bridge,

00:03:08.450 --> 00:03:11.040
and that would be it,
they'd be happy with that.

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:15.600
But with a lot of products
and a lot of new techniques

00:03:15.600 --> 00:03:17.540
being available to the Chinese,

00:03:17.540 --> 00:03:20.450
they've gone into it full force.

00:03:20.450 --> 00:03:23.650
And so now they're into
contouring the face,

00:03:23.650 --> 00:03:27.130
shaving the cheekbones,
shaving the jawbones,

00:03:27.130 --> 00:03:29.850
doing their nose, their
eyes, their breasts,

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:32.420
and fixing their skin.

00:03:32.420 --> 00:03:34.500
China's medical aesthetics industry,

00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:37.990
which includes surgery,
injections, and skin treatments,

00:03:37.990 --> 00:03:40.740
has been growing at an unmatched rate.

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:42.500
Its cosmetic surgery market,

00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:45.320
which was virtually
non-existent a few decades ago,

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:48.860
is now the second largest
in the world after the U.S.

00:03:48.860 --> 00:03:50.730
With an annual expansion that's more than

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:52.910
three times faster than anywhere else,

00:03:52.910 --> 00:03:55.133
it's poised to become
the biggest this year.

00:03:56.630 --> 00:04:01.083
In 2020, sales revenues were
an estimated $51 billion.

00:04:02.940 --> 00:04:04.700
Like many industries in China,

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:07.610
technology and innovation
over the last two decades

00:04:07.610 --> 00:04:09.023
have played a central role.

00:04:10.052 --> 00:04:13.430
In early 2000, majority of the
marketing was done offline,

00:04:13.430 --> 00:04:16.030
just traditional
advertising on the streets.

00:04:16.030 --> 00:04:19.510
But then it sort of gradually
evolved on to Baidu,

00:04:19.510 --> 00:04:22.283
so more sort of on the internet
browser searches based.

00:04:23.150 --> 00:04:25.540
But then in the recent past few years,

00:04:25.540 --> 00:04:29.420
we've seen lots of vertical
integrated mobile phone apps

00:04:29.420 --> 00:04:31.820
being advanced in the market.

00:04:31.820 --> 00:04:33.946
Woo. Look's fancy.

00:04:35.590 --> 00:04:37.090
Be kind.

00:04:37.090 --> 00:04:39.760
Lengths of my two eyes
are different, it says.

00:04:41.009 --> 00:04:43.780
GengMei, which means more
beautiful in Chinese,

00:04:43.780 --> 00:04:46.120
and So-Young, are just two of the many

00:04:46.120 --> 00:04:48.240
social networking platforms in China

00:04:48.240 --> 00:04:50.650
dedicated to cosmetic surgery.

00:04:50.650 --> 00:04:53.920
I can't read this, but it's
obviously saying it's perfect.

00:04:53.920 --> 00:04:56.080
From connecting prospective patients,

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:58.040
to recommending nearby surgeons,

00:04:58.040 --> 00:05:01.250
and even offering micro loans
to pay for the treatments,

00:05:01.250 --> 00:05:04.650
these apps are a one-stop
shop for all things beauty.

00:05:04.650 --> 00:05:06.120
Cute face.

00:05:06.120 --> 00:05:07.270
Great.

00:05:07.270 --> 00:05:08.710
Within minutes of logging on,

00:05:08.710 --> 00:05:10.840
a user can book and pay for pretty much

00:05:10.840 --> 00:05:12.910
any treatment on the market.

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:14.940
And if you can't decide
what you want done,

00:05:14.940 --> 00:05:16.780
it can help with that too.

00:05:16.780 --> 00:05:18.743
Aloof girl's face, who needs filler?

00:05:20.810 --> 00:05:22.640
So I think this is now a lot more

00:05:22.640 --> 00:05:24.620
first hand and interactive.

00:05:24.620 --> 00:05:27.440
Consumers can now quite
easily get their hands on

00:05:27.440 --> 00:05:29.110
to really understand some of

00:05:29.110 --> 00:05:30.758
the treatment they want to receive.

00:05:34.142 --> 00:05:35.320
For many consumers,

00:05:35.320 --> 00:05:38.060
the apps offer more
transparency around procedures

00:05:38.060 --> 00:05:40.740
than previous forms of advertising.

00:05:40.740 --> 00:05:43.250
And the sheer volume of
information available

00:05:43.250 --> 00:05:46.950
has made the decision to go
under the knife much easier.

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:49.160
So-Young has already
been downloaded more than

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:53.203
400 million times in China
since its launch in 2014.

00:05:54.070 --> 00:05:57.740
Because of the internet
and the way they advertise,

00:05:57.740 --> 00:06:01.010
of course, that knowledge
becomes instantly available

00:06:01.010 --> 00:06:03.440
to anybody looking for plastic surgery.

00:06:03.440 --> 00:06:05.860
So it has really grown.

00:06:05.860 --> 00:06:07.220
But public awareness around

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:10.170
unhealthy beauty standards are growing.

00:06:10.170 --> 00:06:12.250
In August, China's market regulator

00:06:12.250 --> 00:06:15.570
drafted guidelines to reform
advertising practices,

00:06:15.570 --> 00:06:18.120
saying that they were
prompting societal anxiety

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:19.373
over people's looks.

00:06:21.450 --> 00:06:25.438
They try to appeal to
their potential consumers.

00:06:25.438 --> 00:06:28.390
And with the message that, you know,

00:06:28.390 --> 00:06:32.390
your body is something
that you can improve,

00:06:32.390 --> 00:06:35.280
so meaning that even your
identity is not pinned down.

00:06:35.280 --> 00:06:36.870
So then that's one of the strategy.

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:41.000
And then what we call in
academia, interpolation.

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:43.900
So meaning that, you position the consumer

00:06:43.900 --> 00:06:48.030
in a place where they feel that

00:06:48.030 --> 00:06:51.583
they are summoned to
consume these products.

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:55.620
Then they also have diverse procedures.

00:06:55.620 --> 00:06:59.010
So they made it so at
different price range.

00:06:59.010 --> 00:07:00.340
Whether you have lots of money,

00:07:00.340 --> 00:07:03.510
and then you can have
something more expensive.

00:07:03.510 --> 00:07:06.150
But if you even have not so much money,

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:07.620
but you can still save money,

00:07:07.620 --> 00:07:10.000
and to have a simple procedure.

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:13.860
Cost is always a factor when
it comes to cosmetic surgery

00:07:13.860 --> 00:07:16.023
because that's disposable income, right?

00:07:17.060 --> 00:07:18.370
Millennials in China,

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:21.440
many of whom have grown up as
part of the One-Child Policy,

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:24.003
have more disposable
income than ever before.

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:27.460
The country will more than
double the number of millionaires

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:29.810
in the next five years, and boost the size

00:07:29.810 --> 00:07:31.903
of its middle class by almost half.

00:07:32.860 --> 00:07:37.340
Cosmetic surgery is a
conspicuous consumption.

00:07:37.340 --> 00:07:41.050
So in a sense, it was almost
like a luxury item, right?

00:07:41.050 --> 00:07:42.510
And when people have more money,

00:07:42.510 --> 00:07:44.420
they have more disposable income.

00:07:44.420 --> 00:07:46.980
So they feel that it's all right

00:07:46.980 --> 00:07:49.950
to use that money as kind of investing

00:07:50.850 --> 00:07:53.650
to show that they can consume something

00:07:53.650 --> 00:07:56.893
that was not available to
the previous generation.

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:01.550
But even for those with a little less cash

00:08:01.550 --> 00:08:04.090
to spend, there are options.

00:08:04.090 --> 00:08:07.750
Traditional surgery to
give you a nasal bridge

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:11.610
with a piece of silicone,
or a piece of Gore-Tex,

00:08:11.610 --> 00:08:16.060
would cost upwards of $10,000.

00:08:16.060 --> 00:08:18.940
But with a syringe of filler,

00:08:18.940 --> 00:08:21.350
which you can just inject in the clinic,

00:08:21.350 --> 00:08:25.940
you can get a semblance of
that improved projection,

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:27.960
and contouring of the nose

00:08:27.960 --> 00:08:30.350
and that costs about one tenth,

00:08:30.350 --> 00:08:33.440
if not less, than the surgery itself.

00:08:33.440 --> 00:08:37.240
So for somebody who's a
little tight on budget,

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:40.830
they would tend to do the
non-surgical procedures,

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:44.930
which are infinitely cheaper
than the surgical procedures,

00:08:44.930 --> 00:08:47.410
and with fewer complications.

00:08:47.410 --> 00:08:50.680
So that has been a burgeoning market

00:08:50.680 --> 00:08:53.840
and it's always what
we call the entry point

00:08:53.840 --> 00:08:58.770
for these young people who wish
to dabble in plastic surgery

00:08:58.770 --> 00:09:01.233
as they would dabble with new makeup.

00:09:02.300 --> 00:09:04.380
The average age for those
going under the knife

00:09:04.380 --> 00:09:09.000
in China is 24 years old,
with over 80% being female.

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:10.390
And the number of under '20s

00:09:10.390 --> 00:09:13.070
opting for treatments is increasing.

00:09:13.070 --> 00:09:14.800
One of the most popular procedures

00:09:14.800 --> 00:09:17.693
among the younger clientele
is double eyelid surgery.

00:09:19.060 --> 00:09:24.060
I did a double eyelid
surgery in July, 2016,

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:27.260
after the university entrance examination.

00:09:27.260 --> 00:09:29.230
I did it mainly for two reasons.

00:09:29.230 --> 00:09:32.870
The first is, I don't
like my single eyelid.

00:09:32.870 --> 00:09:35.510
It is very difficult to make up.

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:37.240
Another reason is my mom,

00:09:37.240 --> 00:09:39.780
she thinks my eyes are too small.

00:09:39.780 --> 00:09:42.933
So a surgery is very necessary.

00:09:45.920 --> 00:09:49.480
Eyelid surgery was one of
the popular procedures.

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:51.540
For one thing, it was quite affordable

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:53.340
in comparison to a nose job.

00:09:53.340 --> 00:09:56.340
So it might cost just a
couple hundred US dollars,

00:09:56.340 --> 00:09:58.473
say about 1000 Chinese yuan.

00:09:59.420 --> 00:10:01.240
This one child policy, I mean,

00:10:01.240 --> 00:10:03.220
parents are quite willing to

00:10:03.220 --> 00:10:05.150
help their children to get started

00:10:05.150 --> 00:10:07.763
in a very competitive society.

00:10:08.730 --> 00:10:12.390
I heard about, numerous
stories actually, about parents

00:10:12.390 --> 00:10:15.400
paying for this kind of simple surgery

00:10:15.400 --> 00:10:19.260
as a gift for graduation, for example.

00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:20.570
Beyond just aesthetics,

00:10:20.570 --> 00:10:22.880
some consumers hope
that changing their face

00:10:22.880 --> 00:10:24.820
may change their fate in the country's

00:10:24.820 --> 00:10:27.330
highly competitive job market.

00:10:27.330 --> 00:10:30.930
Today, you have to be
beautiful to succeed.

00:10:30.930 --> 00:10:33.600
The competition to find
a job is so fierce,

00:10:33.600 --> 00:10:37.130
many believe being operated
on helps you stand out.

00:10:37.130 --> 00:10:40.160
A new report is drawing
attention to widespread gender

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:43.293
discrimination in job ads
for Chinese companies.

00:10:44.380 --> 00:10:46.910
In 2018, a human rights watch report

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:48.580
pointed to several job postings

00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:53.020
that openly specified requirements
in gender and appearance.

00:10:53.020 --> 00:10:55.260
Changing their aesthetic beauty,

00:10:55.260 --> 00:10:58.930
they can somehow enjoy
some social advantages.

00:10:58.930 --> 00:11:01.340
Several people tell me that
they can find a better job,

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:03.550
for example, at a job market.

00:11:03.550 --> 00:11:07.430
Or they feel that it's a
investment in a sense that,

00:11:07.430 --> 00:11:11.560
in the long term, they can
get some kind of a return.

00:11:11.560 --> 00:11:13.250
It's not so much about whether or not

00:11:13.250 --> 00:11:16.200
they like to have cosmetic surgery,

00:11:16.200 --> 00:11:18.570
but rather they feel that
that's an opportunity

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:20.290
that they cannot miss out.

00:11:20.290 --> 00:11:22.440
So if they can actually
invest a little bit money,

00:11:22.440 --> 00:11:26.190
and then undergo a painful procedure,

00:11:26.190 --> 00:11:29.160
but however, there is a reward at the end.

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:33.830
So they will try their best to
do it, if they can afford it.

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:35.220
Like many parts of the world,

00:11:35.220 --> 00:11:37.740
beauty standards are being
set and exacerbated by

00:11:37.740 --> 00:11:40.352
the presence of influencer
and celebrity culture.

00:11:42.710 --> 00:11:45.940
They're constantly
bombarding the internet space

00:11:45.940 --> 00:11:50.370
with images of what they think
a beautiful face should be

00:11:50.370 --> 00:11:52.420
and people therefore follow that

00:11:52.420 --> 00:11:54.420
and feel that that's
what we should look like

00:11:54.420 --> 00:11:55.930
because everybody else is doing it

00:11:55.930 --> 00:11:57.900
and all the influencers that have

00:11:57.900 --> 00:12:00.150
a certain kind of facial look.

00:12:00.150 --> 00:12:04.590
So this does rub off on the younger people

00:12:04.590 --> 00:12:09.020
and it's exactly the same in
China as it is in Singapore,

00:12:09.020 --> 00:12:10.833
or any other part of Asia.

00:12:11.770 --> 00:12:15.090
In the Chinese culture,
that kind of peer pressure

00:12:15.090 --> 00:12:20.090
and emulation can become a
norm that people internalized,

00:12:20.780 --> 00:12:23.480
and then they try and
kind of spread around.

00:12:23.480 --> 00:12:26.210
You will see something in the celebrities,

00:12:26.210 --> 00:12:28.900
sometimes they might have
a doctor that's special,

00:12:28.900 --> 00:12:32.820
and they would really
sort of speak quite openly

00:12:32.820 --> 00:12:35.193
and in-depth about some of the treatments.

00:12:47.020 --> 00:12:48.500
But the same influencers

00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:49.560
that help build the buzz

00:12:49.560 --> 00:12:52.213
have also fallen victim
to its darker side.

00:12:53.380 --> 00:12:55.490
During the industry's explosive growth,

00:12:55.490 --> 00:12:57.500
demand for surgery massively outgrew

00:12:57.500 --> 00:13:01.330
the number of qualified
practitioners able to supply it.

00:13:01.330 --> 00:13:04.460
Unlicensed clinics began
performing illegal surgeries,

00:13:04.460 --> 00:13:07.150
which led to some fatalities.

00:13:07.150 --> 00:13:09.430
About 40,000 medical accidents

00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:12.110
occur in these unlicensed
clinics every year;

00:13:12.110 --> 00:13:14.593
an average of about 110 per day.

00:13:15.860 --> 00:13:20.400
China had over 80,000
unlicensed institutions in 2019,

00:13:20.400 --> 00:13:23.450
accounting for about 84% of the market.

00:13:23.450 --> 00:13:25.010
With uncertified physicians

00:13:25.010 --> 00:13:27.983
making up 72% of all practitioners.

00:13:28.900 --> 00:13:30.790
But change could be coming.

00:13:30.790 --> 00:13:33.260
We will make more notable
and substantial progress

00:13:33.260 --> 00:13:35.800
toward achieving well-rounded
human development

00:13:35.800 --> 00:13:38.360
and common prosperity for all.

00:13:38.360 --> 00:13:40.980
President Xi Jinping's
Common Prosperity Plan

00:13:40.980 --> 00:13:43.270
has seen entire sectors ordered to change

00:13:43.270 --> 00:13:45.180
the way they do business.

00:13:45.180 --> 00:13:46.630
The government really is pushing through

00:13:46.630 --> 00:13:49.330
some house cleaning when it
comes to China's economy.

00:13:49.330 --> 00:13:52.150
They are talking about
enforcing laws and regulations

00:13:52.150 --> 00:13:55.270
on so many corners of the
economy, at the moment.

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:57.700
Industries that ballooned
over recent decades

00:13:57.700 --> 00:13:59.600
have faced particular scrutiny.

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:01.030
Leading analysts to question

00:14:01.030 --> 00:14:04.103
how long it will be before
the cosmetic sector gets hit.

00:14:05.040 --> 00:14:06.530
Since the start of July,

00:14:06.530 --> 00:14:08.980
the market value of the
country's three biggest

00:14:08.980 --> 00:14:11.550
publicly traded medical
aesthetics companies

00:14:11.550 --> 00:14:13.380
has fallen by a third,

00:14:13.380 --> 00:14:17.540
representing a collective
loss of more than $17 billion,

00:14:17.540 --> 00:14:20.270
as the industry plays a waiting game.

00:14:20.270 --> 00:14:22.300
So I think naturally there will be

00:14:22.300 --> 00:14:23.570
some reform in the market,

00:14:23.570 --> 00:14:27.050
both in terms of
crackdowns on malpractice.

00:14:27.050 --> 00:14:29.630
By that I mean companies that do not have

00:14:29.630 --> 00:14:32.880
the business license and
the right accreditation

00:14:32.880 --> 00:14:35.290
to operate or give surgery in the market.

00:14:35.290 --> 00:14:38.010
And I think second is
also regarding the reform

00:14:38.010 --> 00:14:41.190
on how authority can better regulate

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:43.683
some of the advertising
of these institutes.

00:14:44.640 --> 00:14:47.450
I can understand if there are changes

00:14:47.450 --> 00:14:52.450
that could truncate, or
curtail part of the industry,

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:54.390
or make it less profit driven.

00:14:54.390 --> 00:14:56.390
So that would probably be the trend

00:14:56.390 --> 00:14:57.980
because industry's like that,

00:14:57.980 --> 00:14:59.325
at least in the Chinese case,

00:14:59.325 --> 00:15:03.463
always serve the ideology
of the ruling government.

00:15:06.150 --> 00:15:07.880
But there are signs that the market

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:11.240
could survive under a more
watchful eye from Beijing.

00:15:11.240 --> 00:15:14.370
Medical tourism could even
become a driver for the economy,

00:15:14.370 --> 00:15:18.040
if the government can ease
widespread safety concerns.

00:15:18.040 --> 00:15:21.290
They've made these special
medical tourism zones

00:15:21.290 --> 00:15:25.460
where foreign companies can go
and set up much more easily.

00:15:25.460 --> 00:15:27.070
Foreign doctors can go

00:15:27.070 --> 00:15:30.440
and get their license
much more easily as well.

00:15:30.440 --> 00:15:31.800
There are certain tax breaks

00:15:31.800 --> 00:15:34.180
that I think are afforded to them.

00:15:34.180 --> 00:15:37.620
And so a number of
American, European companies

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:40.630
have moved into these areas to set up shop

00:15:40.630 --> 00:15:43.930
so that they can open
up manufacturing plants,

00:15:43.930 --> 00:15:46.530
and provide China with a constant stream

00:15:46.530 --> 00:15:49.240
of these, essentially,
foreign-made products

00:15:49.240 --> 00:15:52.590
and I think the Chinese
authorities have done this

00:15:52.590 --> 00:15:54.020
because they realized that

00:15:54.020 --> 00:15:57.910
medical tourism is a very big item

00:15:57.910 --> 00:16:00.874
and can bring in a lot of tourist dollars.

00:16:04.870 --> 00:16:08.100
Plastic surgery is a very
normal thing in China.

00:16:08.100 --> 00:16:10.223
Many young people will change something

00:16:10.223 --> 00:16:12.290
they're not very satisfied with.

00:16:12.290 --> 00:16:16.697
But I don't think beauty is everything,

00:16:16.697 --> 00:16:21.210
but the confidence maybe
can really take you

00:16:21.210 --> 00:16:23.850
some more, better opportunities.

00:16:23.850 --> 00:16:26.790
But I think if you are not beautiful,

00:16:26.790 --> 00:16:28.950
but you are very confident and talented,

00:16:28.950 --> 00:16:33.320
the opportunity is also there for you.

00:16:33.320 --> 00:16:37.176
So I don't think it's just
the benefits of the beauty.

